WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.200
CHAD: Let’s talk about images.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.200
You’re working on a presentation
or slide deck

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.500
and need visuals that reflect
your awesome, diverse workplace.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.600
You type a prompt
into an AI image generator—

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.800
and the results?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.800
All the same.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.300
Same faces. Same ages. Same vibe.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.000
Definitely not representative.
What now?
